      "refersTo": "navigation-active",
      "description": "Rose-selected desktop navigation item with an outline icon.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-nav-active\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"/><path d=\"M10 9H8\"/><path d=\"M16 13H8\"/><path d=\"M16 17H8\"/></svg><span>Documents</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-nav-active{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;width:100%;padding:12px 13px;border:0;border-radius:7px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;text-align:left;color:var(--accent,#b83d62);background:var(--rose,#fbeaf0);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms,border-color 160ms;}.ds-nav-active:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#b83d62);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-nav-active svg{flex-shrink:0;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav-active{transition-duration:.01ms!important;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Keyword Tag",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "keyword-tag",
      "description": "Passive topic keyword; no invented interactive states.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-keyword\">repair</span>",
      "css": ".ds-keyword{display:inline-block;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:9px;color:#756879;background:#f5f1f5;border-radius:4px;padding:3px 7px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quick Start",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "quick-start",
      "description": "Border-defined starter with a supporting blue icon tile and muted explanatory line.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-quick-start\"><span class=\"ds-starter-icon\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"/><path d=\"M16 2v4\"/><path d=\"M3 10h18\"/><path d=\"M8 14h.01\"/><path d=\"M12 14h.01\"/><path d=\"M16 14h.01\"/><path d=\"M8 18h.01\"/><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"/><path d=\"M16 18h.01\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-starter-copy\"><strong>Build a timeline</strong><small>Find dates, events and deadlines</small></span><span class=\"ds-starter-arrow\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-quick-start{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:18px 16px;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--line,#e9e5e8);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;color:#25232b;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms,border-color 160ms;}.ds-quick-start:hover{background:#fcf8fa;border-color:#e3c2ce;}.ds-quick-start:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#b83d62);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-starter-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:9px;flex-shrink:0;background:#eaf3fb;color:#476880;}.ds-starter-copy{flex:1;}.ds-starter-copy strong{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:550;margin-bottom:5px;}.ds-starter-copy small{display:block;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted,#69636c);}.ds-starter-arrow{color:#b2a7b2;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-quick-start{transition-duration:.01ms!important;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Question Composer",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "composer",
      "description": "Rose-bordered white composer with faint depth and an explicit send action.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-composer\"><textarea class=\"ds-composer-input\" aria-label=\"Ask about your documents\" placeholder=\"Ask about your documents\u2026\"></textarea><div class=\"ds-composer-tools\"><span class=\"ds-document-context\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"/><path d=\"M10 9H8\"/><path d=\"M16 13H8\"/><path d=\"M16 17H8\"/></svg> 0 documents</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-send\" aria-label=\"Send question\" disabled><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 7-7 7 7\"/><path d=\"M12 19V5\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-composer{background:#fff;color:#25232b;border:1px solid #e5cad4;border-radius:16px;padding:16px 18px 12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px #38222e07;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;}.ds-composer:focus-within{border-color:#c87692;}.ds-composer-input{width:100%;min-height:72px;max-height:240px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:0;resize:vertical;background:transparent;color:#25232b;caret-color:var(--accent,#b83d62);font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;}.ds-composer-input::placeholder{color:#79727d;opacity:1;}.ds-composer-input:focus-visible{outline:1px solid var(--accent,#b83d62);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-composer-tools{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-top:1px solid #f5f1f3;padding-top:11px;margin-top:10px;}.ds-document-context{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted,#69636c);}.ds-send{display:grid;place-items:center;width:33px;height:33px;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:var(--accent,#b83d62);color:#fff;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms,border-color 160ms;}.ds-send:hover{background:var(--accent-dark,#9e2d50);}.ds-send:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#b83d62);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-send:disabled{background:#f2dae3;color:#9d6e80;cursor:not-allowed;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-send{transition-duration:.01ms!important;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Source Citation",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "citation",
      "description": "Source name and page remain together in the source-dialog action.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-citation\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"/><path d=\"M10 9H8\"/><path d=\"M16 13H8\"/><path d=\"M16 17H8\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-citation-name\">Document name</span><span class=\"ds-citation-page\">Page 1</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-citation{display:inline-flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;max-width:100%;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 8px;background:#fcf2f6;color:var(--accent-dark,#9e2d50);font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:11px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms,border-color 160ms;}.ds-citation:hover{background:#f7e1e9;}.ds-citation:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#b83d62);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-citation-name{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;}.ds-citation-page{color:#8c687a;font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-citation{transition-duration:.01ms!important;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Provider Choice",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "provider-choice",
      "description": "Native radio selection with provider identity and key status.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-provider\"><input class=\"ds-provider-radio\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ds-provider\" checked/><span class=\"ds-provider-monogram\">C</span><span class=\"ds-provider-copy\"><strong>Claude</strong><small>Claude models, directly from Anthropic</small></span><span class=\"ds-provider-status\">Key needed</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-provider{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;border:1px solid #c87692;border-radius:10px;padding:19px;background:#fdf8fa;color:#25232b;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;cursor:pointer;}.ds-provider:hover{background:#fdf8fa;}.ds-provider-radio{accent-color:var(--accent,#b83d62);}.ds-provider-radio:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#b83d62);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-provider-monogram{display:grid;place-items:center;width:35px;height:35px;border-radius:9px;background:#f6ede5;color:#8f5840;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;flex-shrink:0;}.ds-provider-copy{flex:1;min-width:0;}.ds-provider-copy strong{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:550;}.ds-provider-copy small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted,#69636c);margin-top:6px;}.ds-provider-status{font-size:10px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--muted,#69636c);}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "overview": "The confirmed visual reference is the user's TencentCloud/Octop desktop chat screenshot. Preserve its quiet white workspace, pale sidebar, restrained rose selection, outline icons and generous composer under the Case File Manager identity. The implementation carries that language through document tables, specialist agent rows, review tasks and provider selection.\n\nThe visual system is compact and practical: fine borders establish structure, muted labels support the content, and rose draws attention to selection and primary actions. No new creative metaphor has been selected. This document records the implemented system rather than proposing another visual direction; page strategy remains in `docs/design/workspace.md`.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "White content with a pale sidebar and restrained rose actions.",
      "System sans typography and consistent outline icons.",
      "Border-defined rows and panels with softly curved controls.",
      "Source passages and external consent presented in focused dialogs."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Rose Selection Rule",
        "body": "Keep primary action and selection treatments in the established rose family across views.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Border-First Rule",
        "body": "Preserve row dividers and tonal grouping for ordinary content; keep elevated shadows on the composer, dialogs and transient upload feedback.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve the confirmed Octop-inspired white workspace, pale sidebar and rose selection under the Case File Manager identity.",
      "**Do** use the existing system sans hierarchy, outline icons and visible action labels.",
      "**Do** keep source names, locations and cited passages visually connected.",
      "**Do** use row dividers and subtle surfaces for dense document, agent and task collections.",
      "**Do** preserve keyboard focus, reduced-motion behavior and text alongside semantic status colors."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** reuse Octop's mascot or branding in place of the Case File Manager identity.",
      "**Don't** replace the restrained rose action palette with topic-agent or provider identity colors.",
      "**Don't** add large shadows or decorative art to ordinary table and list surfaces.",
      "**Don't** hide source or consent actions behind unlabeled icons when their existing text labels explain the action."
    ]
  }
}
